":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"P18084","text":"Integrin alpha-V/beta-5 (ITGAV:ITGB5) is a receptor for fibronectin. It recognizes the sequence R-G-D in its ligand. (Microbial infection) Integrin ITGAV:ITGB5 acts as a receptor for adenovirus type C."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}